  "title": "Mitsubachi Maaya no Bouken",
  "justification": "TVDB season 1 carries the German broadcast list, 52 episodes in another order than AniDB's Japanese one, so by default nearly every episode fell on another story. Episodes pair by the named character and the story: 6 \"Tonbo no Schnook\" is E3 \"Maya And The Dragonfly Shnuck\", 7 \"Iebae no Pook\" is E5 \"Maya And The Housefly Puck\", 8 \"Kumo to Komoriuta\" is E6 \"Maya And The Spider Thekla\", 11 \"Mimizu wa Mimizu\" is E9 \"Maya And The Earthworm Max\", 13 \"Ari ni Natta Willie\" is E8 \"Willi With The Ants\", 17 \"100 no Kokoro to 100 no Ashi\" is E17 \"The Centipede Jerome\", 20 is E12 \"Firefly Jimmy\", 24 \"Semi no Uta\" is E21 \"The Cicadas Concert\", 42 \"Ga no Jack\" is E39 \"Jack And The Moth\", 47 \"Hitoribocchi no Champion\" is E44 \"The Mole Cricket With Everything But Friends\", 52 \"Okaeri Maya\" is E52 \"Maya Comes Home\", and the rest by their synopses. Episodes 3, 4, 5 and 49 match none of the four TVDB episodes left over (E46, E48-E50) and are unmapped. TVDB's dates are consecutive placeholder days and were not used.",
